463 0 obj
  << /ActualText (EDUCATION \n\nSacred Heart University                                                                                                                                                                                             Fairfield\054 CT\nM\056S\056 in Computer Science \046 Information Technology \174 GPA\072 8\05689\05710                                                                                                                09\0572023 \055 12\0572024\nSelected Coursework\072\240UX Design\054 Advanced Web Development\054 Human\055Computer Interaction\054 Mobile Application Development\054 Data Structures and Algorithms\054 Software Engineering\nAAR Mahaveer Engineering College \050JNTU\051                                                                                                                                                  Hyderabad\054 India\nB\056Tech in Computer Science Engineering \174 GPA\072 7\05625\05710                                                                                                                                    09\0572019 \055 07\0572023\nSelected Coursework\072\240Object\055Oriented Programming\054 Database Management Systems\054 Web Technologies\054 Software Testing\054 User Experience Design\054 Human\055Computer Interaction\n\nSKILLS\n\nDesign Tools\072 Figma\054 Adobe XD\054 Sketch\054 Photoshop\054 Adobe Illustrator\nUX\057UI Methods\072 User Research\054 Wireframing\054 Prototyping\054 Usability Testing\054 Accessibility \050WCAG\051\054 Inclusive Design\nFrontend Development\072 HTML5\054 CSS3\054 JavaScript \050ES6\053\051\054 React\056js\054 React Native\054 Responsive Design\nStyling \046 UI\072 Styled Components\054 Tailwind CSS\054 Bootstrap\nDevelopment Tools\072 Git\057GitHub\054 VS Code\054 Vite\054 npm\054 Chrome DevTools\nAI Tools\072 ChatGPT\057Claude \050research synthesis\054 ideation\051\054 GitHub Copilot \050prototyping\051\054 Midjourney \050visual exploration\051\nBackend \046 APIs\072 Node\056js\054 RESTful APIs\054 JSON\054 API Integration\nCertifications\072 Google UX Design Professional Certificate\054 Communication Skills Certificate\054 Python Programming Certificate\n\nEXPERIENCE\n\nProduct Designer \046 UI Engineer\054 Starteryou Inc\056\054 New York\054 NY \050Remote\051                                                                                                02\0572025 \055 Present\n\055 Lead end\055to\055end product design and development for mobile and web applications\054 from concept and prototyping through production implementation using React\056js\054 React Native\054 and Figma\n\055 Design and build accessible\054 performance\055optimized UI component library and design system\054 bridging design specifications with scalable front\055end architecture\n\055 Own the design\055to\055code workflow\072 translate user needs into interactive prototypes\054 validate through testing\054 then implement pixel\055perfect\054 responsive interfaces across platforms\n\055 Leverage AI tools to accelerate research synthesis\054 design iteration\054 and code generation while maintaining high standards for craft and user experience\n\055 Partner with cross\055functional teams in Agile environment to shape product strategy\054 ensure technical feasibility\054 and deliver cohesive experiences balancing user needs with business goals\n\nGraduate Assistant\054\240Sacred Heart University                                                                                                                                                   05\0572024 \055 07\0572024\nAssisted instructors with course planning and student engagement initiatives\054 facilitating learning for 50\053 students across multiple computer science courses\nLed tutoring sessions and clarified technical concepts including data structures\054 algorithms\054 and web development to support diverse learning needs\nEvaluated student assignments and provided constructive feedback to enhance understanding and improve code quality\054 contributing to a 15\045 improvement in average class performance\nEncouraged peer collaboration and built supportive learning environment through organized study groups and office hours\n\nPROJECTS\n\nPortfolio \050CTO Of Starteryou\051                                                                                                                                                                                                 \nDesigned and developed responsive portfolio showcasing design thinking and technical implementation skills using React with modern UI featuring glass\055morphism effects\054 smooth animations\054 and gradient backgrounds \055 Led design process from wireframes to high\055fidelity prototypes to production code\054 demonstrating end\055to\055end ownership of product experience with mobile\055first responsive approach\nPopnwrap \050E\055Commerce Site\051                                                                                                                                                                                                  \nLed product design and full\055stack development for e\055commerce platform\054 conducting user research to inform shopping cart UX\054 checkout flow design\054 and integrated Stripe payment experience \055 Created design system and built responsive React components with Node\056js backend\054 implementing RESTful API architecture and MongoDB database for scalable product management\nArt Gallery Management System                                                                                                          \nDesigned and developed user\055centered gallery management interface with focus on accessibility and visual hierarchy\054 implementing authentication flows and intuitive artwork categorization \055 Built responsive React application with modern component architecture\054 creating seamless cross\055device experience for browsing and managing art collections)
     /K [ 1 ]
